  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Hosav's UI Settings"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Hosav's UI Settings"
   },
   "Key": "6F9C1A324641B6E8C2CACF9EF7E82989"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Healthbar Settings"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Healthbar Settings"
   },
   "Key": "F11306E04C61093FF06228B857B1A101"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Staminabar Custom Color"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Staminabar Custom Color"
   },
   "Key": "61B6AD544A7BA49ED83694A39C99BD77"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - If the server is PVE, this can be enabled to see nearby players stamina."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - If the server is PVE, this can be enabled to see nearby players stamina."
   },
   "Key": "D3262D2840F870D8EB8C22B3E3612C01"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Replaces the vanilla target healthbar with my custom version which you can change the looks of with below settings"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Replaces the vanilla target healthbar with my custom version which you can change the looks of with below settings"
   },
   "Key": "F4B94E8542459F4FA2EC9DBA09D1DF0A"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Shows player and thrall party when you have invited or been invited to one."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Shows player and thrall party when you have invited or been invited to one."
   },
   "Key": "C929F4A5486A837795C60FBC4B58E5F0"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Change what buff information to show/hide"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Change what buff information to show/hide"
   },
   "Key": "27799A0A443E40226EC790A30CD72B5B"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Other settings for the UI that is not neccessarily connected to the custom UI (like the hotbar)"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Other settings for the UI that is not neccessarily connected to the custom UI (like the hotbar)"
   },
   "Key": "62ED21644924B79268AF15A0D9F6EC21"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Instead of the vanilla HUD, you can use my custom UI with loads of customisable options below"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Instead of the vanilla HUD, you can use my custom UI with loads of customisable options below"
   },
   "Key": "CD4FAB6942925777A77F709F9A31766B"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - An always accurate display of damage the enemy/ally has taken in their healthbar."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - An always accurate display of damage the enemy/ally has taken in their healthbar."
   },
   "Key": "3E10DBDB417167E694E0B3B4EE473852"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - more options for the custom UI to customize what elements you want to have enabled or change. "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - more options for the custom UI to customize what elements you want to have enabled or change. "
   },
   "Key": "3BF448B94C5E47B88DA241BB0CFE01BB"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Shows a compass in my custom UI that shows N, W, E and S and which direction the player is facing"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Shows a compass in my custom UI that shows N, W, E and S and which direction the player is facing"
   },
   "Key": "5122D59D4A23CA02CABCF18F0F4AB2EB"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "- Will disable all the IQoL UI Elements on your in-game HUD"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "- Will disable all the IQoL UI Elements on your in-game HUD"
   },
   "Key": "66ABDCE24F130B858042D29A23C305A7"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Combat Settings"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Combat Settings"
   },
   "Key": "3EE05D1648288882307D99A057EA9B06"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "- Will make your hotbar invisible unless you are in your inventory"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "- Will make your hotbar invisible unless you are in your inventory"
   },
   "Key": "E0AF3F5842DC27E1E0F39C82168F9553"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - When crafting, will show how many seconds are left before the item is finished crafting (CURRENTLY DISABLED TO INVESTIGATE AN ISSUE)"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - When crafting, will show how many seconds are left before the item is finished crafting (CURRENTLY DISABLED TO INVESTIGATE AN ISSUE)"
   },
   "Key": "7291F5D940167C0904AACDBE0B8CF6C2"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "- Set the size of your hotbar"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "- Set the size of your hotbar"
   },
   "Key": "3F3D9627446D9304A34F9AAD5A3411B1"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Will move the HUD down just above the hotbar by default, if hotbar only in inventory is enabled, the HUD will move even further down."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Will move the HUD down just above the hotbar by default, if hotbar only in inventory is enabled, the HUD will move even further down."
   },
   "Key": "5AE1EF2A4E47B11C21EACA90D2569F9C"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - If you want a visible black background for your HUD so it is easier to see, you can increase the opacity."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - If you want a visible black background for your HUD so it is easier to see, you can increase the opacity."
   },
   "Key": "9C70000D429918D5E71F61B1B4ECDFF4"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Show Server FPS, current player amount and your Ping to the server"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Show Server FPS, current player amount and your Ping to the server"
   },
   "Key": "B405B899493C592D4D402081EE1FB9F6"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Show in-game time"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Show in-game time"
   },
   "Key": "6640146945E801FCA82EA48E988E8FCC"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - If you have AoC, having this enabled will show your faction icon just below your level bar"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - If you have AoC, having this enabled will show your faction icon just below your level bar"
   },
   "Key": "0E58F01146ABDB83A9E4FEBE3DCB176C"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Show what armor type you have, how much armor and the % damage reduction"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Show what armor type you have, how much armor and the % damage reduction"
   },
   "Key": "85D1C021465E0B01BF8BF7AF879C694A"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Show weapon damage, armor penetration and total damage after calculating your stats"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Show weapon damage, armor penetration and total damage after calculating your stats"
   },
   "Key": "B9354AAE41DB4377C32F8AA6E882948C"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Custom Personal UI"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Custom Personal UI"
   },
   "Key": "1FF30B2C482F3496157D5586E8270072"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Show temperature in Temperature type set above"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Show temperature in Temperature type set above"
   },
   "Key": "A81EFCE146FFE5719423FAA4154EEC04"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Show how much weight you have right now out of the max and how many % encumbered you are."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Show how much weight you have right now out of the max and how many % encumbered you are."
   },
   "Key": "550CA09A4D2AA03DB22D6CB956610C92"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Show how much food you have and how much time is left until it runs out"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Show how much food you have and how much time is left until it runs out"
   },
   "Key": "DD545808465EFA303B7FC9A839A25832"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Show how much water you have and how much time is left until it runs out"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Show how much water you have and how much time is left until it runs out"
   },
   "Key": "F6C9FA014BDB5A3FBB22CCA262DE2D7B"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Set the font size of water, food, armor info etc in the HUD"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Set the font size of water, food, armor info etc in the HUD"
   },
   "Key": "3ED06C98405C0728FA02D88353C008B9"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Show how much health is reduced (more accurate than vanilla) from corruption"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Show how much health is reduced (more accurate than vanilla) from corruption"
   },
   "Key": "3E6ADBD040B3ACF5E30B62AFDE6A43DA"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Setup what will show up when targeting someone"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Setup what will show up when targeting someone"
   },
   "Key": "F8C60F8641F7688229E32784534CA9E4"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Disabling this will disable any healthbars showing up in combat"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Disabling this will disable any healthbars showing up in combat"
   },
   "Key": "C3BFFA6C4DCC0B282B93528747CBAD9C"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - If you want to remove the Bazaar button from the tab screen in your inventory etc. Not all of us even wanna see that."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - If you want to remove the Bazaar button from the tab screen in your inventory etc. Not all of us even wanna see that."
   },
   "Key": "25C860354A532FC5C89D24898CED04D2"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Show how much Shelter you have with a progress bar and percentage."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Show how much Shelter you have with a progress bar and percentage."
   },
   "Key": "D8286D394BFEDCD757C40D9B186F21F2"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Custom Target UI"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Custom Target UI"
   },
   "Key": "6094289145A7FBD45A2DA6BB1A2E90DC"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Set the color of the same text as mentioned above and their respective icons "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Set the color of the same text as mentioned above and their respective icons "
   },
   "Key": "87A128424919CCFAF07BB5BC759A0CAA"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Kill XP Feedback"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Kill XP Feedback"
   },
   "Key": "5314330E40015D815A637B91CB60A61A"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "- Will show amount of experience you get when you kill someone or something."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "- Will show amount of experience you get when you kill someone or something."
   },
   "Key": "F750D50443125E1F464385A693F1579F"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Kill XP Feedback Background"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Kill XP Feedback Background"
   },
   "Key": "39EF59A546CAEB43EC0691A8990682A5"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "- Will show or hide the blood background for XP Feedback"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "- Will show or hide the blood background for XP Feedback"
   },
   "Key": "880FA5034BA9A90558B637ACF1602A66"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Kill XP Feedback Names"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Kill XP Feedback Names"
   },
   "Key": "4D1289FA431AE1B708CD51818DCFE517"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "- Will show or hide the name of the killed enemy for XP Feedback"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "- Will show or hide the name of the killed enemy for XP Feedback"
   },
   "Key": "09EC9C86458DA9AEEDB7F4BBD3915765"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Kill XP Feedback Amount"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Kill XP Feedback Amount"
   },
   "Key": "9045538C4DBCB145785C63BA3AF2E9DD"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "- Will show or hide the amount of XP for the XP Feedback"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "- Will show or hide the amount of XP for the XP Feedback"
   },
   "Key": "F980A1794570C00AD7E10C957514891C"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Kill XP Feedback Sound"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Kill XP Feedback Sound"
   },
   "Key": "351D4ADF4049F778DF537D9365ED6BA4"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Stamina Color Picker"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Stamina Color Picker"
   },
   "Key": "FCCBB2C44FCCB56313A80383B7A625D6"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "- Will enable or disable a low volume sound when the XP feedback shows up."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "- Will enable or disable a low volume sound when the XP feedback shows up."
   },
   "Key": "E52A771B4D88475293BB0B9EC12E35F9"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Damage Indicator Icons"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Damage Indicator Icons"
   },
   "Key": "87CA810C49D13BC2EB402B935040323B"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Enables or Disables Icons for the Damage Indicator"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Enables or Disables Icons for the Damage Indicator"
   },
   "Key": "0C1D62BF49C7526A19CC5AA63744ED20"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Simplistic Damage Indicator"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Simplistic Damage Indicator"
   },
   "Key": "DDA373994736BEE228E952AABCB1BF07"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - With Simplistic Enabled you will only see how much damage you dealt. With it off you will see who you damaged as well."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - With Simplistic Enabled you will only see how much damage you dealt. With it off you will see who you damaged as well."
   },
   "Key": "3695228E4AFCCA84701188828B0DF517"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Damage Indicator for Follower (Left)"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Damage Indicator for Follower (Left)"
   },
   "Key": "1767CCAA4B7529B2CB11768807A3A226"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Shows MMO Type Damage Indicator that pops up on the screen as your thrall does damage. "
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Shows MMO Type Damage Indicator that pops up on the screen as your thrall does damage. "
   },
   "Key": "38E10F4749AC9DAF893E019F164E40D9"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Follower Damage Indicator Icons"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Follower Damage Indicator Icons"
   },
   "Key": "D293D9DF4ADAEF64EF997084260BB89B"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - Enables or Disables Icons for the Follower Damage Indicator"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - Enables or Disables Icons for the Follower Damage Indicator"
   },
   "Key": "0B09137A4E133821A87304BCABCCF197"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Follower Simplistic Damage Indicator"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Follower Simplistic Damage Indicator"
   },
   "Key": "0234A3CE4816DD62188B4FB72AB51966"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Mount Settings"
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": "Mount Settings"
   },
   "Key": "1C6FFDAC40C9507C2A76A791EC38EE3F"
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": " - With Simplistic Enabled you will only see how much damage your follower dealt. With it off you will see who your follower damaged as well."
   },
   "Translation": {
    "Text": " - With Simplistic Enabled you will only see how much damage your follower dealt. With it off you will see who your follower damaged as well."
   },
   "Key": "DE0079AF4861D46D3EA35691C698DD34"
  },
